<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <%- include("../partials/default")%>
    <title>License - Creative Commons</title>
</head>
<style>
    * {
        box-sizing: border-box;
        margin: 0;
        padding: 0;
    }

    body {
        font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
        background-color: var(--bg-dark);
        color: var(--text-light);
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        min-height: 100vh;
    }

    .license-main {
        margin-top: var(--header-size);
        display: flex;
        justify-content: center;
        align-items: center;
        flex-grow: 1;
        padding: 40px 20px;
    }

    .license-container {
        background-color: var(--bg-card);
        padding: 2.5rem;
        border-radius: 12px;
        text-align: left;
        max-width: 650px;
        width: 100%;
        box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);
        border: 1px solid rgba(116, 140, 171, 0.1);
        z-index: 1;
    }

    .license-header {
        text-align: center;
        margin-bottom: 2rem;
    }

    .license-icon {
        font-size: 3rem;
        margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
        display: inline-block;
    }

    h1 {
        color: var(--accent-pink);
        font-size: 2rem;
        font-weight: 600;
        margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
    }

    h2 {
        color: var(--accent-pink);
        font-size: 1.3rem;
        margin: 1.5rem 0 0.5rem 0;
        font-weight: 600;
    }

    p, ul {
        color: var(--light-blue);
        font-size: 1rem;
        line-height: 1.6;
        margin-bottom: 1rem;
    }

    ul {
        padding-left: 1.5rem;
    }

    li {
        margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
    }

    a.license-link {
        color: var(--accent-pink);
        text-decoration: none;
        font-weight: bold;
    }

    a.license-link:hover {
        text-decoration: underline;
    }

    .btn-wrapper {
        text-align: center;
        margin-top: 2rem;
    }

    .btn {
        display: inline-block;
        background-color: transparent;
        color: var(--accent-pink);
        border: 2px solid var(--accent-pink);
        padding: 0.8rem 1.8rem;
        font-size: 1rem;
        font-weight: bold;
        border-radius: 6px;
        text-decoration: none;
        transition: all 0.3s ease;
    }

    .btn:hover {
        background-color: var(--accent-pink);
        color: var(--bg-dark);
        box-shadow: 0 0 15px rgba(255, 218, 233, 0.4);
        transform: translateY(-2px);
    }

    @media (max-width: 480px) {
        .license-main {
            margin-top: var(--header-phone-size);
            padding: 20px 15px;
        }

        .license-container {
            padding: 1.75rem;
        }

        h1 { font-size: 1.6rem; }
        h2 { font-size: 1.1rem; }
        p, li { font-size: 0.95rem; }
        .btn { width: 100%; }
    }
</style>
<body>
    <%- include("../partials/floatingbg")%>
    <%- include("partials/header")%>
    
    <main class="license-main">
        <div class="license-container">
            <div class="license-header">
                <div class="license-icon">🫱🏼‍🫲🏾</div>
                <h1>License & Copyright</h1>
                <p>Creative Commons Attribution-NonCommercial-ShareAlike 4.0 International</p>
            </div>

            <p>The content on this website (text, images, and code, unless stated otherwise) is licensed under a <strong>CC BY-NC-SA 4.0</strong> license. This means you are free to share and adapt my work for non-commercial purposes, as long as you follow these conditions:</p>
            
            <h2>Terms of Use:</h2>
            <ul>
                <li><strong>Attribution (BY):</strong> You must give appropriate credit, provide a link to the license, and indicate if changes were made.</li>
                <li><strong>NonCommercial (NC):</strong> You may not use the material for commercial purposes or financial gain.</li>
                <li><strong>ShareAlike (SA):</strong> If you remix, transform, or build upon the material, you must distribute your contributions under the same license as the original.</li>
            </ul>

            <h2>Additional Restrictions:</h2>
            <p>You may not apply legal terms or technological measures that legally restrict others from doing anything the license permits. Any use outside of these non-commercial terms requires explicit written permission from the author.</p>

            <p>This is a human-readable summary. You can read the full official legal code directly on the <a href="https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-sa/4.0/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="license-link">Creative Commons website</a>.</p>

            <div class="btn-wrapper">
                <a href="/en" class="btn">Return to home</a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </main>

    <%- include("partials/footer")%>
</body>
</html>